# ReadOS MSP protocol provenance

This package is ReadOS-owned code authored in this repository. It defines a
versioned, byte-slice-only protocol boundary over the ReadOS-owned
`msp-kernel` contracts. It contains no copied upstream MSP implementation and
has no process, filesystem, Windows API, ABI, or managed-runtime dependency.

The protocol deliberately projects native values into safe wire DTOs. Hosts
remain responsible for policy, audit, cancellation state, and execution.
